  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Letters and packages",
   "texto": [
    "**Scrisoare** already means «letter»; here we use it to order the service. **Colet** is «package» and **plic**, «on». For a shipment, the address of the consignee is asked."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Cortez formula",
   "texto": [
    "**Aș dori** sounds more polite than **vreau** («I want to»). **Scrieți** is used as a formal request to one or more persons: «escriba / escriban»."
   ]
